                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce7032bf-b10f-3d31-892b-3fe92ce76002",
                        "entry_id": "ca84ed75-cf23-3f1e-a482-3e2828a65768",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. специалист в области неврологии; врач, занимающийся диагностикой и лечением болезней, связанных с нервной системой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93238813-f542-4cc9-8be0-5aa2b2b46bef",
                                "sense_id": "ce7032bf-b10f-3d31-892b-3fe92ce76002",
                                "text": "Преподаватель медицины почти в полном её объёме, но главным образом невролог по своим преобладающим интересам, Келлен приписывал нервной системе главнейшую роль в жизни животного организма."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a1a9f1a-29b4-4bdb-87f9-27442ac21fa7",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca84ed75-cf23-3f1e-a482-3e2828a65768",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce7032bf-b10f-3d31-892b-3fe92ce76002",
                        "target_lang_word": "neurologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "neurologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "702938e6-9bb2-38a4-b5d7-7f454e316d1d",
                                        "entry_id": "95a26307-01b4-3538-b8b3-0e7bff6a219c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A doctor or scientist who practices or specializes in neurology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40d41657-ae7d-489d-9348-d1c4c9ebfd8d",
                                                "sense_id": "702938e6-9bb2-38a4-b5d7-7f454e316d1d",
                                                "text": "When a neurologist ruled out medical causes like Lyme disease, Ms. Abaspour recalled, her husband said, “I think we should just give her a placebo — it’s all in her head.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cf1fd9f-e1d5-4bcc-b3c8-f860c8014f68",
                                                "sense_id": "702938e6-9bb2-38a4-b5d7-7f454e316d1d",
                                                "text": "And most neurologists are in the habit of prescribing antispasticity drugs like tizanidine and baclofen, which are oral and inexpensive, but which cause drowsiness and weaken every muscle in the body, not just the target ones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
